{"lines": [{"text": "There's a tiny weight inside your phone that never sits still.", "start": 0.3, "end": 3.594}, {"text": "It lives in a chip just two millimetres wide.", "start": 3.944, "end": 6.535}, {"text": "Inside, a sliver of silicon hangs on microscopic springs.", "start": 6.885, "end": 10.65}, {"text": "Around it are comb-like fingers, each thinner than a human hair.", "start": 10.95, "end": 14.469}, {"text": "Tilt your phone, and gravity pulls the weight slightly to one side.", "start": 14.819, "end": 18.419}, {"text": "The gaps between the fingers change, and so does the electric charge between them.", "start": 18.719, "end": 23.37}, {"text": "The chip reads that change hundreds of times a second, in all three directions.", "start": 23.671, "end": 28.125}, {"text": "That's how your screen knows when to rotate. And how your phone counts your steps.", "start": 28.425, "end": 32.763}], "total": 32.763, "words": [{"w": "There's", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.658, "line": 0}, {"w": "a", "s": 0.658, "e": 0.777, "line": 0}, {"w": "tiny", "s": 0.777, "e": 1.04, "line": 0}, {"w": "weight", "s": 1.04, "e": 1.398, "line": 0}, {"w": "inside", "s": 1.398, "e": 1.756, "line": 0}, {"w": "your", "s": 1.756, "e": 2.019, "line": 0}, {"w": "phone", "s": 2.019, "e": 2.329, "line": 0}, {"w": "that", "s": 2.329, "e": 2.591, "line": 0}, {"w": "never", "s": 2.591, "e": 2.902, "line": 0}, {"w": "sits", "s": 2.902, "e": 3.164, "line": 0}, {"w": "still.", "s": 3.164, "e": 3.594, "line": 0}, {"w": "It", "s": 3.944, "e": 4.118, "line": 1}, {"w": "lives", "s": 4.118, "e": 4.442, "line": 1}, {"w": "in", "s": 4.442, "e": 4.617, "line": 1}, {"w": "a", "s": 4.617, "e": 4.741, "line": 1}, {"w": "chip", "s": 4.741, "e": 5.015, "line": 1}, {"w": "just", "s": 5.015, "e": 5.289, "line": 1}, {"w": "two", "s": 5.289, "e": 5.514, "line": 1}, {"w": "millimetres", "s": 5.514, "e": 6.136, "line": 1}, {"w": "wide.", "s": 6.136, "e": 6.535, "line": 1}, {"w": "Inside,", "s": 6.885, "e": 7.46, "line": 2}, {"w": "a